    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "challenge-market-context",
        "moduleId": "driver-and-context",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "技术尚不成熟且市场分散",
        "markdown": "教材指出，机构投资学习分析时首先要面对相关技术仍处于初期、市场缺乏整合的问题。VLE、SIS、商业智能与可视化软件以及新兴的定制学习分析包之间，厂商正在争夺商业主导地位。HeLF 调查发现机构在考虑多种不同方案，包括自行开发；Jisc 访谈的十三所领先机构之间，所部署的系统也几乎没有共同点。来自英国高教界的一项主要诉求，是一个可供机构开始试验的基础学习分析方案。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-6b22d7784a983e92d3f54d80",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000025"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "3. How learning analytics works",
                "Technical infrastructure"
              ],
              "lineStart": 139,
              "lineEnd": 147,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "77960ebc222ff40688a0e7f65976c2dc632a2192833864f48d918f350597250a"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fragmentation-cost",
        "moduleId": "driver-and-context",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "补充：碎片化为何构成负担",
        "markdown": "模型补充：当各家机构分别采购和自建系统时，重复建设、接口不一致与经验难以复用会同时出现。因此是否有共同架构不是采购细节，而是决定机构能否以较低成本开始试验的前提。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "challenge-market-context"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "data-sources-to-warehouse",
        "moduleId": "architecture-components",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "数据源汇入 learning analytics warehouse",
        "markdown": "教材给出的基础架构把来自 VLE、SIS、图书馆系统以及学生自述数据的数据统一汇入 learning analytics warehouse。warehouse 承担的是把分散数据集中起来、为后续分析提供统一入口的角色。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-6b22d7784a983e92d3f54d80",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000025"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "3. How learning analytics works",
                "Technical infrastructure"
              ],
              "lineStart": 139,
              "lineEnd": 147,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "77960ebc222ff40688a0e7f65976c2dc632a2192833864f48d918f350597250a"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "warehouse-as-integration-layer",
        "moduleId": "architecture-components",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "补充：warehouse 是集成层而非展示层",
        "markdown": "模型补充：可以把 warehouse 理解为数据流的汇合点。它本身不直接面向教师或学生，而是把异构来源整理成可被分析组件读取的形态；这与仪表盘等展示层的职责不同。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "data-sources-to-warehouse"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "processor-and-intervention",
        "moduleId": "architecture-components",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "processor 分析并导向 alert 与 intervention",
        "markdown": "架构的核心是 learning analytics processor，预测分析在这里执行，并导向由 alert and intervention system 协调的行动。也就是说，分析结果不是终点，而是被转化为可执行的提醒与干预。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-6b22d7784a983e92d3f54d80",
